    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overreacting. i've always been a bit of an athlete so maybe my body is just adjusting back after being sick? like if i just take a really high dose of magnesium and maybe some extra iron for a week, that would basically fix any deficiency right? i'm pretty sure i can just power through this with some vitamins and rest. what's the harm in trying that first?",
